ovie right around  the corner we thought it would only be  right to include the franchise in our  list of Disney plot holes to the  question we have for the Toy Story  creators is why did Buzz Lightyear  freeze in front of Andy every time that  he walked into the room well the obvious  answer that first comes to mind is that  he doesn't want any humans to know that  toys are alive because the result would  probably be  genera except doesn't buzz totally  reject the idea that he is a toy  throughout pretty much of the entire  movie so why then would a space  commander on an intergalactic mission  freeze whenever Andy came into the room  we don't really have the answers for you  guys but let's hope that this plot hole  is clarified in the upcoming movie  Cinderella if you've made it this far  it's safe to say that you are one brave  Disney fan let us know by leaving a  green heart in the comment section now  let's take a little throwback journey to  Cinderella's magical fairy tale  Cinderella story was one for the ages  with a gorgeous soundtrack and  captivating storyline Cinderella was one  of the few princesses to come in contact  with a fairy that was in fact her very  own fairy godmother fairy godmother was  ready to wave her wand and make all of  Cinderella's dreams come true except for  one minor detail that we're hoping was  all a part of the fairy godmothers  master plan she tells Cinderella that at  the stroke of midnight all of the magic  spells keeping Cinderella's enchanted  items in their forms would be broken  this would mean that her carriage would  turn back into a pumpkin her horses back  into mice and her gown and slippers back  into rags and shoes now you might all  see where we're going with this if  everything was meant to turn back into  its original form then why does  Cinderella's glass slipper remain as it  was what do you guys think tangled now  we have Rapunzel from the fan favorite  tangled movie with her gorgeous long  blonde hair and fun-loving personality  it is no wonder that Rapunzel was quick  to become one of Disney's most beloved  princesses her adventures with Flynn  or should we call him Eugene and the  rest of the gang how does absolutely  charmed by the spirited princess fairy  tale but this video isn't exactly meant  to point out what we love about these  Disney movies so let's get right down to  business so if you've seen our princess  Sofia video then you know that  Rapunzel's healing powers come from a  magical golden flower the flower has  healing properties that were given to  Rapunzel's mother after she fell ill  during her pregnancy this is the  original movies idea behind why  Rapunzel's hair is magical in the scene  where Flynn cuts her hair you may have  noticed it  Brown now this might have made sense if  Rapunzel's healing powers were just in  her hair except we know that that isn't  true we see proof of that when  Rapunzel's Tears say Flynn telling us  that the actual healing power is inside  of her following that logic wouldnt the  leftover hair still connected to her  body stay blonde  and why did Mother Gothel turn to dust  if Rapunzel's Magic's were still ablaze  this Disney plot hole has puzzled us  from the get-go but we love tangled so  much we're willing to give it the  benefit of the doubt the Little Mermaid  last but definitely not least is a plot  hole that we just wish we could unlearn  but for those of you brave enough to  have made it this far we hope you're  ready this fairy tale was brought to us  a pretty long time ago but has remains  one of Disney's top tier movies until  this very day this underwater fairy tale  is none other than the Little Mermaid we  love Ariel her charming prince gorgeous  sisters and loyal friends so we  definitely never wanted to believe that  there could be something wrong with this  iconic tale in the first Little Mermaid  movie Ariel signs a contract with Ursula  in order to turn herself into a human  and pursue Prince Erik now the only  issue is that she trades in her voice  and can't exactly defend herself when he  falls under Ursula's in disguise spell  so why did an Ariel just write Erik a  letter explaining everything who we see  that she can read and write as she signs  her name on the contract so what exactly  where the Disney creator is thinking  well we don't have the answers for you  guys we can definitely tell you that our  childhood favorites will never be the  same still that's never stopped us from  watching them over and over again and  let's face it Disney movies are where  it's at before you go make sure to let  us know which Disney plot hole you found  to be the most shocking and let us know  if you've ever spotted some Disney plot  holes of your own and that's a wrap give  this video a big thumbs up if you  enjoyed it thanks for watching the  things see you next time  [Music]
 

